  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Central Bank of Yemen and Ministry of Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities funded under the Economic Resilience and Livelihoods Program (ERLP) with UK funds are unique to technical assistance efforts in Yemen by other donors, providing long-term sustainable support directly to the staff of the CBY and government ministries, helping with the design and implementation of reforms to achieve stability, while building capacity of staff with the organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
